# Doc citations that tests/test_docs_evidence.py cannot resolve in this repository.
# One `token  # reason` per line; `*` matches any run of characters. Every entry needs a reason,
# and an entry no doc needs any more fails the test (remove it).
#
# --- Not in this repository: another repo, a third-party library, a service API, build output ---

capability.yaml  # a file in each capability's own repository (the manifest canopy-web validates), not here
infra/capabilities/android-emulator/capability.yaml  # a capability repository's manifest
.canopy/jobs.yaml  # a file in an agent's own repository
SKILL.md  # the skill file inside each agent repository
skills/*/SKILL.md  # skill files live in each agent repository
connect_labs/*  # the connect-labs repository
infra/labs-*.yml  # the connect-labs repository's CloudFormation files
orchestrator/device_key.py  # the canopy CLI repository
config/gating.json  # the canopy plugin's gating rules (canopy repository)
kb_*  # tools of the canopy plugin's `projects` MCP server (canopy repository)
HttpAgent  # the AG-UI client library
useCopilotAction  # CopilotKit, which a host app may use
CopilotPopup  # CopilotKit
CopilotSidebar  # CopilotKit
CopilotRuntime  # CopilotKit
strict_required_status_checks_policy  # GitHub's ruleset API field
merge_queue  # GitHub's ruleset rule type
site/dist  # build output of the Astro site (not tracked)
page_scrollToRow  # an example page action a host defines in its own code
canopy-ui/chat/turnStatus.ts  # package-relative shorthand for frontend/packages/canopy-ui/src/chat/turnStatus.ts
_role_changed  # shorthand for the suffix of the participant_role_changed event name

